    "customize": [
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "人物关系"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7489,
        "name": "尼伯龙根",
        "desc": "<p>元素龙的首领，提瓦特大陆的原始创造者。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/05/26/326985891/596896f7ea3d51d7b1f6e504094f9d97_8669269055712867996.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "原初之龙创造了三月女神与三轮月亮，并将她们升起至天上。在",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9095,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "期间，尼伯龙根囚禁了月神们，并将月亮改造成了武器。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7625,
        "name": "三月女神",
        "desc": "<p>艾莉亚、桑娜妲与卡侬——是三位姐妹，也是曾经统治苍穹的月神。哥伦比娅·希珀塞莱尼娅是在三月女神陨落数千年后诞生的月神。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/08/02/317661877/1f76253cb02cf46c0f6d8b836271b6f2_1336603059689273640.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 23
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "卡侬是霜月女神——第二轮诞生、同时也是最亮的月亮。夜晚得以因她而有了不灭的寒灯。「霜月」是在",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9095,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "中唯一未被摧毁的月亮。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9338,
        "name": "艾莉亚",
        "desc": "<p>恒月女神。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/19/326985891/a2acc52e0870cb103da56037249720e4_6721579846662816907.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9339,
        "name": "桑娜妲",
        "desc": "<p>虹月女神。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/19/326985891/60ceaba0c8911e94ed390a1c10e39c67_8120136957570239749.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "卡侬是在中间的姐姐。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7476,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "新的月神。艾莉亚、桑娜妲、和卡侬将她们的权能赋予她，使她成为了「三月女神」。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7622,
        "name": "霜月之子",
        "desc": "<p>传说中黄金国的遗胤，在抛弃旧日的文明后，选择了在山林之间的生活。他们所唯一不曾抛舍的，只有对「月神」的信仰。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/01/21/326985891/495bf3319bc3e1faf3bafaa0ee422e48_2332733928079429057.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 23
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "当",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4897,
        "name": "天理",
        "desc": "<p>第一位降临者，击败了世间的七位龙王，并创造了人类。原初的那一位或许便是法涅斯。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/07/326985891/513d51e0ebfd54f5da34a9f85dfaf61f_3593056138001658182.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "摧毁了人类的文明，包括",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 8939,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 22
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "，卡侬回应了幸存者的祷唤，并引领他们前往",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 8826,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 20
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "。他们称霜月女神为「乌莱库塔尔」，并自称为「霜月之子」，以此向她致敬。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
